| Smart AC            | 3761  | 131    |
| Evaporative Cooler  | 3523  | 139    |
| Package Unit        | 1701  | 105    |

Model:

Objective:
\[
\max \sum_{i \in \{\text{1},\ldots,\text{15}\}} \sum_{j \in \{\text{Window Unit}, \ldots, \text{Package Unit}\}} v_j \cdot x_{ij}
\]

Subject to, for each storage area $i$:
\[
\sum_{j} w_j \cdot x_{ij} \leq C_i \qquad \forall i \in \{\text{1},\ldots,\text{15}\}
\]

Variable domains:
\[
x_{ij} \in \mathbb{Z}_{\geq 0} \qquad \forall i, j
\]

Where:
- $v_j$ and $w_j$ are as given in the table above for each ProductName $j$.
- $C_i$ is as given in the table above for each StorageID $i$.

All data and identifiers are preserved in original order.[0m

